  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building justice and peace through COMMUNITY WELLBEING in South Sudan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">COMMUNITY WELLBEING will strengthen the coping mechanism of marginalised youth (aged 13-30),  including youth with disabilities, survivors of sexual violence, refugees from Sudan as well as IDPs, in South Sudan through provision of psychosocial support and safe spaces. Psychosocial support services will be open to all, while safe spaces through sports and arts groups will majorly focus on youth.</narrative>
  </description>
